#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Form2"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "Current Snapshot"
msgstr "Waitroûlêye do moumint"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&New Snapshot"
msgstr "&Novele waitroûlêye"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"This button creates a snapshot image of the screen.\n"
"\n"
"If the delay is set to \"No Delay\" the snapshot will be taken when you "
"click the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Ci boton chal fwait ene waitroûlêye di çou k' i gn a sol waitroûle.\n"
"\n"
"Si l' tårdjaedje est metou a «Nou tårdjaedje» li waitroûlêye srè "
"fwaite do côp ki vos clitchîz sol boton."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Thumbnail of the current snapshot"
msgstr "Imådjete del waitroûlêye do moumint"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"This is a thumbnail of the current snapshot.\n"
"\n"
"The image can be dragged to another application or document to copy the full "
"screenshot there. Try it with the Konqueror file manager!"
msgstr ""
"Çouchal est ene imådjete del waitroûlêye do moumint.\n"
"\n"
"Vos l' poloz haetchî viè èn ôte programe ou documint po-z î copyî li "
"waitroûlêye en etir. Sayîz avou l' manaedjeu di fitchîs Konqueror!"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Print Snapshot..."
msgstr "&Eprimî l' waitroûlêye..."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This button prints the snapshot."
msgstr "Ci boton chal evoye li waitroûlêye sol sicrirece."

#: ksnapshot.cpp:119 rc.cpp:9
msgid "Save Snapshot &As..."
msgstr "Schaper eyet r&lomer li waitroûlêye..."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "This button saves the snapshot to a location specified by the user."
msgstr ""
"Ci boton chal va schaper li waitroûlêye dins l' fitchî eyet al plaece ki "
"vos dnez."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Save Snapshot"
msgstr "&Schaper li waitroûlêye"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"This button saves the snapshot to the default location, then increments the "
"filename."
msgstr ""
"Ci boton ci va schaper li waitroûlêye dins on fitchî el prémetou "
"eplaeçmint, eyet incrementer li no do fitchî."

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Snapshot &delay:"
msgstr "&Tårdjaedje pol waitroûlêye:"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid " seconds"
msgstr " segondes"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "No delay"
msgstr "Nou tårdjaedje"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Snapshot delay in seconds"
msgstr "Li tårdjaedje divant d' prinde li waitroûlêye, e segondes"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"This is the number of seconds to wait after clicking the <i>New Snapshot</i>"
" button before taking the snapshot.\n"
"<p>\n"
"This is very useful for getting windows, menus and other items on the screen "
"set up just the way you want.\n"
"<p>\n"
"If <i>no delay</i> is set, the program will wait for a mouse click before "
"taking a snapshot.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Çouchal c' est li nombe di segondes a tårdjî après aveur clitchî sol "
"boton <i>Novele waitroûlêye</i> po kel waitroûlêye soeye fwaite.\n"
"<p>\n"
"C' est foirt ahessåve po mete les purneas, menus ou ôtes cayets come vos "
"l' voloz sol waitroûle.\n"
"<p>\n"
"Si <i>nou tårdjaedje</i> n' est dné, li programe va ratinde ki vos "
"clitchîz avou l' sori divant d' prinde li waitroûlêye.\n"
"</p>\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Only grab the window containing the pointer"
msgstr "Prinde &seulmint li purnea ki li curseu est dvins"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid ""
"Checking this option causes only the window that the mouse is over to be "
"captured, when the snapshot is taken."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz cisse tchuze chal si vos vloz ene waitroûlêye di fok on purnea "
"purade ki del waitroûle etire. Li purnea e l' waitroûlêye serè l' ci "
"ki l' curseu est dvins å moumint di prinde li waitroûlêye."

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Include &window decorations"
msgstr "Les gåliotaedjes do &purnea avou"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "When enabled, snapshot of a window will also include the window decorations"
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos vloz eto les gåliotaedjes do purnea (båre di "
"tite, boirdeures) dins l' waitroûlêye"

